<title>UK: Rabobank sets 100 mln rand two-year bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 100 mln rand two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Toronto Dominion and Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.125    MATURITY    07.APR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.95    PAY DATE    07.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    99.95     LISTING     LUX</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
